WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
they're thrilled to hear me speak about it, but that's the way it is. I like to speak my mind

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:10.480
and speak the truth. As we seek to reduce the threat of dangerous weapons today, I'm also

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:16.719
calling on every nation to join us in ending the development of biological weapons once and for

00:00:16.719 --> 00:00:23.200
all. And biological is terrible, and nuclear is even beyond, and we include nuclear in that.

